{#
    Where everybody finished, on a page where that pays nothing.

    <twig:FinishingOrder :rows="archive.finishing_order" />

    The block an unranked tournament closes with. Rank, blader, record and
    form — and **no F1, bonus or total column**, because an unranked event
    writes no `TournamentResult` and there is no such value to show. A zeroed
    column would be the lie the invariant exists to prevent.

    It sits *under* the match archive rather than above it (option 3B): the
    finishing order of an event which scores nothing is the least consequential
    thing on the page, and the matches are the whole reason it was archived.

    `record` and `form` are optional. A row the archive has no matches for
    keeps its place and shows a dash, which is what the two 2v2 evenings would
    look like if either were ever imported unranked.

    The blader is named rather than linked. Every player URL still goes through
    a season and an unranked event has none, so linking one would mean picking
    a season the event was not in; #95's canonical `/player/{slug}` is what
    this row is waiting for.
#}
{% props rows = [] %}

<twig:DataTable bleed>
    <thead>
    <tr>
        <th class="w-12 text-center sm:w-16">Rank</th>
        <th>Blader</th>
        <th class="text-center">W-L-D</th>
        <th class="hidden text-center sm:table-cell">Form</th>
    </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for row in rows %}
        <tr>
            <td class="text-center"><twig:RankMedal :rank="row.rank" /></td>
            <td class="font-bold text-ink">{{ row.name }}</td>
            <td class="whitespace-nowrap text-center font-mono text-xs text-ink-muted">
                {% if row.matches > 0 %}{{ row.wins }}-{{ row.losses }}-{{ row.draws }}{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td class="hidden text-center sm:table-cell"><twig:FormStrip :results="row.form|default([])" /></td>
        </tr>
    {% else %}
        <tr>
            <td colspan="4" class="py-12 text-center text-sm italic text-ink-faint">This bracket recorded no finishing order.</td>
        </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
</twig:DataTable>
